### 2. Task outcome (extremely detailed version):
The gross profit values for the years 2020 and 2019 are derived from the "Consolidated income statement" within the "Financial statements 2020" section of the annual report. According to the report, Gross Profit is defined as "revenues less direct costs of services rendered."

For the financial year ended 31 December 2020:
